{"version":1,"content":"<p>今屆台北金鐘獎因受薔琵颱風影響要作改動，除了節目類頒獎禮日子有變外，星光大道紅地氈亦將移師室內舉行。</p><p>獎項方面，周渝民能否再奪金鐘視帝備受關注，《回魂計》的舒淇及李心潔同時爭「迷你劇視后」，形成「自己人打自己人」局面，話題十足。</p><p>&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:24:54.719350+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:01:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.668937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.668937+00:00","content_hash":"37a303c7ba1b56eb12f332c29059671cd50ba27e33d7ff71e7e24e65809d641c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}